# Normalise line endings in the repository. Two things depend on it:
#  - protos/protos.sha256 pins the vendored .proto files byte-for-byte. A CRLF checkout on Windows
#    changed every hash and failed :protos:verifyProtoPin there (the manifest is also normalised in
#    code, but the source of truth should not depend on a developer's core.autocrlf).
#  - Cargo.lock / rust-toolchain.toml / Kotlin sources feed Gradle and cargo input hashes.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.proto text eol=lf
protos.sha256 text eol=lf
*.rs text eol=lf
*.kt text eol=lf
*.kts text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.gradle text eol=lf
gradlew text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.dylib binary
*.so binary
*.dll binary
*.jar binary
*.png binary
